  "details": "I don't exactly know what this setting is, but I'm guessing its some recent addition to Quest. I don't know if it's on PC, but it completely RUINS some avatars. At least make it a toggle in settings under graphics or something similar. I hate that a chunk of my avatars can be ruined if I apparently run low on memory or whatever. This is especially an issue for avatars that rely on textures for details, and is especially worse for avatars that use low resolution textures to begin with. And there's seemingly no way to avoid it. \n\nI could be completely wrong and this could be a bug or something, but I just hate it. It ruins my avatars and it sucks because I can't do anything about it other than just wait for it to switch back.",
